obs ERRATUM, written before landing: this lap and its successor were BOTH cut mid-send, so neither became testimony until 20260916.004342. The elder GRASS account was rewritten in place rather than shelved, so the archive file this log named was never written and its line is gone; the row's number is %752 rather than the 750 the drafts reached for, twice taken by peers. Landed by the next lap (20260915.232457) after this one was cut mid-send; the one edit before landing is the shelf path above, which the recovery wrote at its own stamp.
